{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "isLocked": false,
  "fallbackResourceIds": [
    "__MODEL_ACCOUNT_RESOURCE_ID__"
  ],
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "intro",
      "content": {
        "json": "## Foundry Model Usage vs Capacity\nCompare account/deployment traffic, then drill into one deployment's **current allocated limits**, not subscription-wide assigned quota. No logs, quota-unit conversions, monitoring backend, or inference calls.\n\nAll capacity drilldown charts use **one-minute buckets**. Missing samples remain missing; reported zero samples remain zero. Capacity is read now from ARM and is not a historical limit series."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "name": "parameters",
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "Subscriptions",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Subscriptions",
            "type": 6,
            "label": "Subscriptions",
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "value": [
              "/subscriptions/__MODEL_ACCOUNT_SUBSCRIPTION_ID__"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "FoundryResources",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "FoundryResources",
            "type": 5,
            "label": "Compare accounts",
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "query": "resources | where subscriptionId in~ ({Subscriptions}) or strcat('/subscriptions/', subscriptionId) in~ ({Subscriptions}) | where type =~ 'microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts' and kind in~ ('AIServices', 'OpenAI') | project value=id, label=strcat(name, ' (', resourceGroup, ')'), selected=false, group=subscriptionId",
            "crossComponentResources": [
              "{Subscriptions}"
            ],
            "queryType": 1,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "showDefault": false
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "TimeRange",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "type": 4,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": {
              "durationMs": 3600000
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                {
                  "durationMs": 3600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 21600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 86400000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 518400000
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "scope-notes",
      "content": {
        "json": "### Subscription comparison and account drilldown\n**Compare accounts: All** includes all eligible discovered accounts in the explicitly selected subscriptions, including new accounts on scope refresh. Choose a manual subset to filter comparison; return to **All** for broad scope. **Investigate resource** below never narrows the overview. Changing comparison scope removes out-of-scope detail selections.\n\nOnly RBAC-accessible accounts are discoverable. Queries request up to **1,000 series per resource/metric**; this is a cap, not proof of complete results. Discovery and grids also have limits; reduce scope/range for large estates. Blank cells/no data are not healthy zeroes; query errors must be investigated."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "comparison-label",
      "content": {
        "json": "### Compare the estate\nSort resource values to identify outliers, then investigate a resource below. Resource links use full IDs; hover for subscription/resource-group context when names collide. Missing values remain unavailable. No statistical anomaly detector or averages-of-averages across resources are used."
      }
    },
